<title>UK: TABLE - Grampian profits surge 30.8 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Grampian profits surge 30.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen months to January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 11.51		 vs  10.24</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   4.65		 vs   n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   6.56		 vs   5.99</p>
<p> Pretax			13.71		 vs  10.48</p>
<p> Turnover		   203.72		 vs 146.93</p>
<p>NOTE - The company announced in November it was changing its year end to January 31 from December 31 previously. Proforma comparisons for 12 months to January 31, 1997 are -- EPS 11.88 pence, pretax 19.89 million, turnover 262.09 million stg.</p>
<p>Current trading was satisfactory, the group said.</p>
<p>Full name of Scotland-based group with interests in retail, veterinary pharmaceuticals, transport and branded leisure goods - Grampian Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
